OL,3,GNEWSAService to mark World Suicide
OL,4,APrevention day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA service to remember people who have
OL,7,Fdied by suicide will be held.
OL,9,FThe event at Shrewsbury Abbey at 14:30
OL,10,FBST was "open to all faiths and none",
OL,11,Fsaid the Shropshire Mental Health
OL,12,FSupport charity, which will host the
OL,13,Fhalf hour service.
OL,15,FThe theme for the day this year was
OL,16,Fchanging the narrative on suicide and
OL,17,F"about moving from a culture of silence
OL,18,Ftowards one of understanding and
OL,19,Fsupport," it added.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
