OL,3,GNEWSAService to mark World Suicide
OL,4,APrevention day
OL,5,
OL,6,FBereavement officer Karen Griffiths
OL,7,Fsaid the day would highlight services
OL,8,Favailable for people who were
OL,9,Fstruggling and that staff could talk to
OL,10,Fpeople and have a cup of tea with them
OL,11,Fafterwards.
